<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,367.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose to 1,367.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Jan 31 Reuter - The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,367 today from 1,361 on Jan 30, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
